{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AutoGen的多Agent对话编排\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"AutoGen的多Agent对话编排\" dir=\"auto\">AutoGen的多Agent对话编排</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请深入分析AutoGen的多Agent对话编排机制，包括GroupChat的发言人选择策略、对话终止条件、人机协作模式，以及其在企业场景中的应用边界。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AutoGen的多Agent对话编排核心</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AutoGen的多Agent协作基于<strong>对话驱动</strong>的设计理念，核心组件包括GroupChat（群聊环境）和GroupChatManager（调度器）。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. GroupChatManager的发言人选择机制</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">GroupChatManager决定\"下一个谁说话\"，支持多种策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>工作原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>auto</strong></td>\n<td>LLM读取对话历史，返回下一个发言Agent的名字</td>\n<td>动态讨论、需要智能调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>round_robin</strong></td>\n<td>按固定顺序轮询每个Agent</td>\n<td>平等参与、确保每个Agent都发言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>random</strong></td>\n<td>随机选择下一个发言人</td>\n<td>头脑风暴、打破固定模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>manual</strong></td>\n<td>人工指定下一个发言人</td>\n<td>人工控制讨论走向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>custom</strong></td>\n<td>用户自定义选择函数</td>\n<td>特殊业务逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>auto策略的内部实现：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># AutoGen GroupChatManager的发言人选择（简化）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GroupChatManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">select_speaker</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> last_speaker<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 构建选择Prompt</span>\n        speaker_selection_prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        你是一个讨论主持人，负责选择下一个发言的人。\n\n        可选参与者：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> agent <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agents<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        讨论历史：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n        请根据讨论内容，选择下一个最合适的发言人。\n        只返回人名，不要解释。\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用LLM选择</span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"system\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> speaker_selection_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        next_speaker_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回对应的Agent</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            agent <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> agent <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agents\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> next_speaker_name\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 对话终止条件</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># AutoGen的终止条件配置</span>\ntermination <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"max_round\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 最大对话轮数</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"termination_message\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 终止触发词</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"角色\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"总结者\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"关键词\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"总结\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"结论\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"TERMINATE\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"is_termination_msg\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"TERMINATE\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 人机协作（Human-in-the-loop）模式</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AutoGen原生支持三种人机协作模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ALWAYS</strong></td>\n<td>每轮对话后都征求人工输入</td>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">human_input_mode=\"ALWAYS\"</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>TERMINAL</strong></td>\n<td>仅在Agent请求时暂停等待人工</td>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">human_input_mode=\"TERMINAL\"</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>NEVER</strong></td>\n<td>完全自动运行</td>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">human_input_mode=\"NEVER\"</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：企业级代码审查系统</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> autogen <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> UserProxyAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> GroupChat<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> GroupChatManager\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 代码审查Agent团队</span>\ncode_reviewer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"代码审查员\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你负责检查代码规范、逻辑正确性和最佳实践。\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"发现问题时提出具体修改建议。\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"审查完成后回复'APPROVED'或'REVIEW_COMPLETE'。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nsecurity_expert <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"安全专家\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你负责检查安全漏洞（SQL注入、XSS、CSRF等）。\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"发现安全问题立即标记为BLOCKER。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nperformance_expert <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"性能专家\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你检查性能瓶颈（N+1查询、内存泄漏、算法复杂度）。\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"标记性能问题并给出优化建议。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 人类开发者（关键决策点介入）</span>\nhuman_developer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> UserProxyAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"开发者\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是代码提交者。在审查通过后确认合并，\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"或在有争议时做出最终决定。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    human_input_mode<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"TERMINAL\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 关键节点人工介入</span>\n    max_consecutive_auto_reply<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 配置群聊</span>\ngroupchat <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GroupChat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    agents<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>code_reviewer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> security_expert<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> performance_expert<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> human_developer<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    max_round<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">8</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    speaker_selection_method<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    allow_repeat_speaker<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 不允许连续发言</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nmanager <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GroupChatManager<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>groupchat<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>llm_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 启动审查</span>\nhuman_developer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>initiate_chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    manager<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"请审查以下代码：[代码内容]\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AutoGen在企业场景中的边界：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>对话驱动，符合人类直觉</td>\n<td>Token消耗高（多Agent×多轮次）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生支持人机协作</td>\n<td>对话可能偏离主题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活的群聊机制</td>\n<td>缺乏持久化（需外部实现）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码执行能力（UserProxyAgent）</td>\n<td>大规模并行能力有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微软生态集成</td>\n<td>学习曲线较陡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：GroupChat的auto策略在选择发言人时可能有什么问题？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：LLM可能选择不合适的发言人（如刚发过言的Agent）；在讨论偏题时无法有效纠正；Token消耗随对话历史增长而增加。可以通过<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">allow_repeat_speaker=False</code>和自定义选择函数优化。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：AutoGen v0.4的重大变化是什么？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：v0.4进行了全面重构，核心变化包括：新的异步架构、改进的健壮性（指标提升300%）、更好的可观测性支持、A2A协议兼容。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：AutoGen适合所有多Agent协作场景。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：AutoGen的对话驱动模式适合讨论型、创意型任务，但不适合严格流程控制、低延迟响应、大规模并发的场景。在这些场景下，LangGraph或CrewAI可能更合适。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}